{"3820740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Stick Together! - Co-op Frog Parkour", "steam_appid": 3820740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Tangled Tongue, A Twisted Journey</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this absurd and hilarious co-op platformer, you and your friends take control of frog brothers, permanently stuck together by their stretchy, sticky tongues. Jump, swing, and scream your way through chaotic obstacle courses where coordination, timing, and trust are the only way forward. Will your friendship survive the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/cd01debc642846a59d2e300370dbe363.poster.avif?t=1770190970\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/cd01debc642846a59d2e300370dbe363.webm?t=1770190970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/cd01debc642846a59d2e300370dbe363.mp4?t=1770190970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > 2 Player Journey: Baby Steps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start your adventure with a friend in the core 2-player experience. Each frog moves independently, but your tongues stay fused, meaning every leap, swing, or fall directly affects your partner. Communication and timing are your greatest tools… or your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/71d331530dcf91630125c34fca2bc6b4.poster.avif?t=1770190970\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/71d331530dcf91630125c34fca2bc6b4.webm?t=1770190970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/71d331530dcf91630125c34fca2bc6b4.mp4?t=1770190970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4 Player Chaos: Double the Frogs, Double the Difficulty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want even more chaos? Grab three friends and dive into 4-player madness. More frogs, more confusion. Discover new strategies to overcome the challenges created by your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/9161142206971b84113e9f2c9007029d.poster.avif?t=1770190970\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/9161142206971b84113e9f2c9007029d.webm?t=1770190970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/9161142206971b84113e9f2c9007029d.mp4?t=1770190970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Stay in Style</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the gold you collect to unlock new outfits and accessories. Show off your unique froggy fashion and stand out from the rest!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/6bd9f7172b116d1bc4860cff8efc7e0b.poster.avif?t=1770190970\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820740/extras/6bd9f7172b116d1bc4860cff8efc7e0b.webm?t=1770190970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source s